      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Infusion of local anesthetics into an extrapleural pocket results in excellent postoperative pain relief through a multilevel intercostal nerve blockade. This report describes a simple, rapid technique of subpleural catheter placement that lends itself well to thoracoscopic procedures."},
